K[1,1] += 3   # K = [[3, -3], [-3, 6]]
if 1 < 1:     # False, skip
```

**Final K = [[3, -3], [-3, 6]]**

**What does this mean physically?**
- K[0,0] = 3: Interior node 1 connects to 1 element (element 0)
- K[1,1] = 6: Interior node 2 connects to 2 elements (element 1 as left node, element 2 will be added... wait)

