### Mathematical Theory References

**IDEA 1 - Poisson Solver:**
```
Strong Form: -k·u'' = f,  u(0) = u(1) = 0
Weak Form: ∫k·u'·v' = ∫f·v,  ∀v ∈ H₀¹
Convergence: ||u - u_h|| ≤ Ch²|u|₂
```

**IDEA 2 - Heat Conduction:**
```
PDE: d/dx(k·dT/dx) + q = 0
Inverse: minₖ ||T(k) - T_measured||²
Analytical: T(x) = sin(πx)/(kπ²) for q=sin(πx)
```

**IDEA 3 - 2D Mesh:**
```
Area: ½|v₁ × v₂| = ½|v₁ₓ·v₂ᵧ - v₁ᵧ·v₂ₓ|
Aspect Ratio: 4√3·Area / (L₁² + L₂² + L₃²)
Quality: 1.0 = equilateral, 0.0 = degenerate
```

