## Quick Reference: Git Commands

```bash
# Check status
git status

# See all branches
git branch -a

# Switch branches
git checkout branch-name

# Update from upstream (main deepchem repo)
git fetch upstream
git checkout master
git merge upstream/master

# Push branch
git push origin branch-name

# See commit history
git log --oneline

# Undo last commit (if needed)
git reset --soft HEAD~1
```

